### Urganchtransgaz API — Test fayli
### VS Code: REST Client extension kerak

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@adminToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ============= Ochiq API =============

### 1. Barcha bo'limlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Bitta bo'lim
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Barcha tashkilotlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Yuqori turuvchi tashkilotlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations?type=yuqori
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Tashkilot rahbarlari
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/1/leaders
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Imzolovchilar
GET {{baseUrl}}/signatories
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Word hujjat generatsiya
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "department_id": 8,
  "organization_id": 1,
  "organization_leader_id": 1,
  "signatory_id": 1,
  "document_number": "125",
  "document_date": "2026-05-13",
  "text_content": "Ushbu hujjat test uchun yaratilmoqda. Barcha ma'lumotlar to'g'ri ko'rsatilishi zarur."
}

###

### ============= Admin API =============

### 8. Admin login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@2024"
}

###

### 9. Admin logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Bo'lim qo'shish
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Yangi bo'lim",
  "index_code": "НБ/",
  "head_name": "Rahbar FISH",
  "head_phone": "2-99"
}

###

### 11. Bo'lim tahrirlash
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/departments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Yangilangan bo'lim",
  "index_code": "ИШ/",
  "head_name": "Yangi Rahbar",
  "head_phone": "2-34"
}

###

### 12. Tashkilot qo'shish
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Yangi tashkilot",
  "type": "quyi"
}

###

### 13. Tashkilot rahbari qo'shish
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizations/1/leaders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "position": "Direktor",
  "full_name": "Rahbar FISH"
}

###

### 14. Imzolovchi qo'shish
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/signatories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "position": "Bosh buxgalter",
  "full_name": "Xoliqova Maftuna Xasan qizi",
  "is_active": true
}
